---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro"
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Community & Contributing"
  description="Open Source Community Hub, contributor guidelines, branch workflow rules, and component creation guide for Ethereal UI."
  categoryLabel="Community"
  toc={[
    { id: "overview", label: "Community Overview" },
    { id: "golden-rules", label: "Golden Rules (Aturan Kontribusi)" },
    { id: "workflow", label: "Contribution Workflow" },
    { id: "component-guide", label: "Menambahkan Komponen Baru" },
    { id: "maintainers", label: "Maintainers & Channels" },
  ]}
>
  <div class="space-y-12">
    <!-- 1. Hero & Community Overview -->
    <section id="overview" class="space-y-4 scroll-mt-20">
      <div class="space-y-2.5">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-blue-700 dark:border-blue-500/30 dark:bg-blue-500/10 dark:text-blue-300">
          <span>Open Source Software (OSS)</span>
          <span>&bull;</span>
          <span>MIT Licensed</span>
          <span>&bull;</span>
          <span>Community Driven</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
          Community &amp; Contribution Hub
        </h1>
        <p class="max-w-3xl text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Selamat datang di komunitas open source <strong>Ethereal UI</strong>! Ethereal UI dibangun dari awal sebagai proyek open source yang transparan, mudah di-extend, dan berfokus pada kualitas tinggi untuk developer React, Next.js, dan Astro. Kami menyambut kontribusi berupa komponen baru, perbaikan bug, peningkatan aksesibilitas, tema baru, maupun dokumentasi.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Action Cards -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3.5 sm:grid-cols-3 pt-2">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/XenchinRyu7/Ethereal-UI"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:shadow-xs"
        >
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary">
                GitHub Repository
              </span>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-foreground">
                <path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0 0 24 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2">
              Berikan Star, clone source code monorepo, dan pantau rilis versi terbaru.
            </p>
          </div>
          <span class="mt-3 text-[11px] font-medium text-primary flex items-center gap-1">
            github.com/XenchinRyu7/Ethereal-UI &rarr;
          </span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://github.com/XenchinRyu7/Ethereal-UI/issues"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:shadow-xs"
        >
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary">
                Issues &amp; Bug Reports
              </span>
              <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2">
              Laporkan bug styling, kendala kontras, atau request komponen baru.
            </p>
          </div>
          <span class="mt-3 text-[11px] font-medium text-primary flex items-center gap-1">
            Buka Issues di GitHub &rarr;
          </span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://github.com/XenchinRyu7/Ethereal-UI/discussions"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 transition-all hover:border-primary/50 hover:shadow-xs"
        >
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary">
                Discussions &amp; RFCs
              </span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-muted-foreground">Community</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2">
              Diskusikan arsitektur komponen, usulan desain, atau tunjukkan showcase buatanmu.
            </p>
          </div>
          <span class="mt-3 text-[11px] font-medium text-primary flex items-center gap-1">
            Ikut Diskusi Komunitas &rarr;
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. Golden Rules (Aturan Utama) -->
    <section id="golden-rules" class="space-y-4 border-t border-border pt-8 scroll-mt-20">
      <div class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
          Golden Rules for Contributing (Aturan Kontribusi)
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
          Setiap kontributor wajib mematuhi aturan berikut agar proses review cepat dan codebase tetap bersih:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/5 p-4 space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-500 text-white font-mono text-xs font-bold">
              1
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">
              Wajib Bikin Branch Sendiri (Branching Rule)
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            <strong>DILARANG KERAS</strong> commit langsung ke branch <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px]">main</code>. Selalu buat branch terpisah untuk setiap fitur atau perbaikan:
          </p>
          <ul class="text-xs space-y-1 text-muted-foreground font-mono">
            <li>&bull; <strong class="text-foreground">feat/</strong>nama-fitur (misal: <code class="text-primary">feat/radial-slider</code>)</li>
            <li>&bull; <strong class="text-foreground">fix/</strong>nama-bug (misal: <code class="text-primary">fix/input-contrast-border</code>)</li>
            <li>&bull; <strong class="text-foreground">docs/</strong>topik (misal: <code class="text-primary">docs/contributing-guide</code>)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-blue-500/20 bg-blue-500/5 p-4 space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-600 text-white font-mono text-xs font-bold">
              2
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">
              Package Manager Wajib Menggunakan PNPM
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Ethereal UI adalah monorepo Turborepo yang dikelola dengan <strong>pnpm</strong> (v9+). Jangan jalankan <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px]">npm install</code> atau <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px]">yarn</code> karena akan merusak <code class="font-mono">pnpm-lock.yaml</code>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 p-4 space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 text-white font-mono text-xs font-bold">
              3
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">
              Wajib Lolos Lint &amp; Build 100%
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Sebelum membuka Pull Request, jalankan perintah validasi:
          </p>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-foreground">
            pnpm turbo run lint &amp;&amp; pnpm turbo run build
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">
            Pastikan seluruh package (@etherealui/react, @etherealui/cli, docs) berstatus hijau tanpa error TypeScript.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-purple-500/20 bg-purple-500/5 p-4 space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-purple-600 text-white font-mono text-xs font-bold">
              4
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">
              Standar Kode &amp; Anti-Slop Policy
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Komponen harus ditulis dengan kode bersih, accessible (Radix UI / ARIA), mendukung Light &amp; Dark mode dengan kontras tinggi, dan <strong>tanpa komentar boilerplate AI yang tidak berguna</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. Contribution Workflow -->
    <section id="workflow" class="space-y-4 border-t border-border pt-8 scroll-mt-20">
      <div class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
          Step-by-Step Contribution Workflow
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
          Ikuti alur standar GitHub flow berikut dari fork hingga PR kamu dimerge:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <!-- Step 1: Fork & Clone -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 space-y-2.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="rounded bg-primary/10 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-primary">Langkah 1</span>
              <span>Fork &amp; Clone Repository</span>
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
            Fork repo resmi di <a href="https://github.com/XenchinRyu7/Ethereal-UI" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline font-mono">github.com/XenchinRyu7/Ethereal-UI</a>, lalu clone ke mesin lokal:
          </p>
          <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted/60 p-3 text-xs font-mono text-foreground"><code># Clone repo fork milikmu
git clone https://github.com/&lt;username-kamu&gt;/Ethereal-UI.git
cd Ethereal-UI

# Tambahkan upstream resmi
git remote add upstream https://github.com/XenchinRyu7/Ethereal-UI.git</code></pre>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2: Install & Branch -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 space-y-2.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="rounded bg-primary/10 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-primary">Langkah 2</span>
              <span>Install Dependencies &amp; Buat Branch Baru</span>
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
            Tarik pembaruan dari <code class="font-mono">upstream main</code> lalu buat branch fitur:
          </p>
          <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted/60 p-3 text-xs font-mono text-foreground"><code># Install dependencies monorepo
pnpm install

# Buat branch terisolasi
git checkout main
git pull upstream main
git checkout -b feat/my-new-component</code></pre>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3: Run Dev Server -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 space-y-2.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="rounded bg-primary/10 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-primary">Langkah 3</span>
              <span>Jalankan Local Documentation Server</span>
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
            Jalankan Astro docs server untuk menguji komponen dan perubahan styling secara real-time:
          </p>
          <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted/60 p-3 text-xs font-mono text-foreground"><code>pnpm dev
# Buka http://localhost:4321 di browser</code></pre>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4: Quality Check & PR -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 space-y-2.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="rounded bg-primary/10 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-primary">Langkah 4</span>
              <span>Validasi &amp; Buka Pull Request (PR)</span>
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
            Pastikan build berhasil, commit dengan format Conventional Commits, push ke fork kamu, lalu buka Pull Request:
          </p>
          <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted/60 p-3 text-xs font-mono text-foreground"><code># 1. Jalankan lint dan build
pnpm turbo run lint &amp;&amp; pnpm turbo run build

# 2. Commit dan push branch
git add .
git commit -m "feat(ui): add MyNewComponent with dark mode contrast"
git push origin feat/my-new-component</code></pre>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground pt-1">
            Buka GitHub fork kamu dan klik <strong>Compare &amp; pull request</strong> ke branch <code class="font-mono">main</code> di repo resmi <strong>XenchinRyu7/Ethereal-UI</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. Component Creation Guide -->
    <section id="component-guide" class="space-y-4 border-t border-border pt-8 scroll-mt-20">
      <div class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
          Panduan Menambahkan Komponen Baru
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
          Tiga tempat yang wajib kamu sentuh saat membuat komponen baru:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-3.5 space-y-1">
          <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-foreground font-mono">
            1. File Komponen: packages/ui/src/primitives/ atau blocks/
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
            Gunakan <code class="font-mono">React.forwardRef</code>, utilitas <code class="font-mono">cn()</code>, styling Tailwind CSS v4, dan border kontras tegas (<code class="font-mono">border-input</code>).
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-3.5 space-y-1">
          <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-foreground font-mono">
            2. Export Library: packages/ui/src/index.ts
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
            Export komponen dan interface props-nya agar bisa diimpor dari <code class="font-mono">@etherealui/react</code>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-3.5 space-y-1">
          <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-foreground font-mono">
            3. Registry Catalog: apps/docs/src/data/registry-catalog.ts
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
            Daftarkan metadata komponen (slug, title, category, dependencies, code demo) agar otomatis muncul di dokumentasi web dan bisa diinstall via CLI.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. Maintainers & Community Channels -->
    <section id="maintainers" class="space-y-4 border-t border-border pt-8 scroll-mt-20">
      <div class="space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
          Lead Maintainer &amp; Community Channels
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
          Terhubung langsung dengan tim pengembang dan kreator Ethereal UI:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5">
          <div class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-blue-600 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-2xs">
            SR
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-foreground">
              Saeful Rohman
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
              Creator &amp; Lead Maintainer of Ethereal UI
            </p>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/XenchinRyu7"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="text-[11px] font-mono text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              @XenchinRyu7 on GitHub
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/XenchinRyu7"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex h-8 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-background px-3 text-xs font-medium text-foreground shadow-2xs hover:bg-accent"
          >
            <span>GitHub Profile</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/XenchinRyu7/Ethereal-UI"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex h-8 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-primary px-3 text-xs font-medium text-primary-foreground shadow-2xs hover:bg-primary/90"
          >
            <span>Star on GitHub ⭐</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
